WEBVTT

00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:08.867
Choose Donations in the side menu.

00:00:09.117 --> 00:00:13.451
Select needs review from the Status list.

00:00:13.701 --> 00:00:19.701
Click Apply.

00:00:48.362 --> 00:00:52.429
Check that addondemo06 shows in the list.

00:00:52.679 --> 00:00:56.409
Select All from the Status list.

00:00:56.659 --> 00:01:00.525
Select Monthly from the Kind list.

00:01:00.775 --> 00:01:06.775
Click Apply.

00:01:34.797 --> 00:01:40.673
Check that No gifts match. shows
because no monthly gifts exist yet.

00:01:40.923 --> 00:01:44.519
Select All from the Kind list.

00:01:44.769 --> 00:01:48.231
Type "03032026" in the From box.

00:01:48.481 --> 00:01:54.481
Click Apply.

00:02:21.538 --> 00:02:25.604
Check that addondemo01 shows in the list.
